            "id": "20260808A047A400",
            "title": "孙宇晨回应福布斯排名超王健林家族：我心里没有波澜，只有警醒，此前曾跟王思聪公开互怼",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OQkb1_yWnnYt6mkE9x9EFcxsRWzDzYdIdNcKf4R2OwVxkAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260808A047A400",
            "author": "万众瞩目",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-08 08:48:23",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:16px 0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.5px\">据界面新闻报道，8月7日，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">波场TRON</span></span></span>创始人、90后<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">加密货币</span></span></span>领域知名人物孙宇晨在社交平台发文，回应自己以85亿美元身家超越王健林家族44亿美元的消息。他表示：“一代版本一代神。看到福布斯榜单上位次互换，我心里没有波澜，只有警醒。王健林当年也曾是版本之神，正如我曾是不被相信的年轻人。版本更迭最残酷之处，是身处巅峰的人总是最后察觉。”</span></span></span></section><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:16px 0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.5px\">他进而提及七年前与王思聪的那段公案：“所以今天若有年轻人对我讲一些我听不懂、甚至想嘲笑的东西，我很难再有王思聪这种自信。我会给他端一杯茶，听他讲讲他的世界。因为傲慢，永远是最先被清算的资产。”</span></span></span></section><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;margin:0px 0px 24px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OMqEex22eVQf3ecP26hx2XvZTb3VoDHtXAH4fuzy9wYSwAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OMqEex22eVQf3ecP26hx2XvZTb3VoDHtXAH4fuzy9wYSwAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;vertical-align:bottom;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:16px 0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.5px\">孙宇晨<!-- -->此次特意提及王思聪，又将七年前的一段公开恩怨重新拉回公众视野。2019年，孙宇晨以456万美元（约3150万元人民币）的天价拍下<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">巴菲特慈善午餐</span></span></span>，意图为<!-- -->区块链<!-- -->行业正名，全网刷屏。彼时背靠万达的王思聪，直接在朋友圈转发相关文章，配文：“这不就是个傻X”，还点评“孙宇晨巴菲特的餐桌上，全是韭菜”。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:16px 0px;max-width:100%;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OKyJ-1FqjjGPqKJ_HL9TtE3Gk29tniXHtQSiFC2r61X70AA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OKyJ-1FqjjGPqKJ_HL9TtE3Gk29tniXHtQSiFC2r61X70AA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:&amp;#34;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;margin:0px;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;user-select:auto;white-space:normal;widows:2;width:100%;word-spacing:0px;height:100%\"/></span></span></section><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 0px 20px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);font-size:16px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;visibility:visible;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span>随后，孙宇晨又连发两条微博直指王思聪：第一条内容是，“听说王思聪骂我”，第二条直接怒斥“靠爹的还敢骂靠自己的”。</span></span></p><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 0px 20px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;visibility:visible;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OVAYy-zndgcYH-hK14VZfGzSXTQ-WleOMmX1s8Nf9L2twAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OVAYy-zndgcYH-hK14VZfGzSXTQ-WleOMmX1s8Nf9L2twAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);border-color:initial;border-style:initial;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;vertical-align:middle;visibility:visible;width:1244px;height:100%\"/></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 0px 20px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);font-size:16px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span>几分钟后，他又发布了另外一条帖子怒斥：靠爹的还敢骂靠自己的，80后还敢骂90后，搞个直播就倒闭的敢骂还在创业的，谁给你的勇气？</span></span></p><section style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 0px 20px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OZ_W-3hqUr6_L3ywTXYZ2KNa6lL6raIHY7nbbcCEXlM_UAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OZ_W-3hqUr6_L3ywTXYZ2KNa6lL6raIHY7nbbcCEXlM_UAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);border-color:initial;border-style:initial;border-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;vertical-align:middle;width:1244px;height:100%\"/></section><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75em;margin:0px 0px 20px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);font-size:16px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);float:none;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;orphans:2;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;display:inline !important\"><span>两人的“互怼”可以追溯到更早。2014年，王思聪曾微博评价<!-- -->比特币<!-- -->是“忽悠”，随后孙宇晨在意义当脱口秀节目中回怼王思聪“高帅是假的，只有富是真的”。</span></span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"ms85ljlp1sgt\" style=\"color:#888888;font-size:14px\"><span mpa-font-style=\"ms88t74oddx\" style=\"font-size:12px\">来源：中国综合界面新闻、此前报道</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"ms88t74o1w2z\" style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(136, 136, 136)\">编辑：李明阳</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"ms85ljlpv68\" style=\"color:#888888;font-size:14px\"><span mpa-font-style=\"ms88t74o6kd\" style=\"font-size:12px\">责编：宋方灿</span></span></section></div>",
